&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span&gt;How to use them in Esoteric Classes ?&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-966983-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;Remember to use lowercase letters, bro.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;help&quot;&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beginning of include ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Item # of SCP ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clearance Level &lt;em&gt;USE DIGITS (5,4,3,2,1,0)&lt;/em&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/anomaly-classification-system-guide&quot;&gt;See guide here&lt;/a&gt;)↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Container Class (Also known as Object Class) ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OPTIONAL Secondary Class (If Using, set Container Class to &lt;em&gt;Esoteric&lt;/em&gt;) ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If secondary class is used, place URL to Class Icon here ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Disruption Class (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/anomaly-classification-system-guide&quot;&gt;See Guide&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; Read Below for Explanation) ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Risk Class (&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scp-wiki.net/anomaly-classification-system-guide&quot;&gt;See Guide&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; Read Below for Explanation) ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;End of include ↦&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;[[&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;include&lt;/span&gt; :scp-wiki:component:anomaly-class-bar-source&lt;/tt&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
