&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Colloquially referred to as the &amp;quot;Blue-Ringed Octopus&amp;quot; due to the conspicuous markings along its body.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. A species of gray octopus designed to mimic SCP-5176.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. Indicating a slightly torn spacetime barrier&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Great white shark&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-5&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;5&lt;/a&gt;. Tuna&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-6&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;6&lt;/a&gt;. Whale shark&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-7&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;7&lt;/a&gt;. Literally transcribed, the name is &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ruthas&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-8&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;8&lt;/a&gt;. Anxiety triggered by the open ocean, deep space, or similarly dark, open expanses of emptiness.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-9&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;9&lt;/a&gt;. A model of the expansion of the universe that takes into account homogenous and isotropic universal models.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-10&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;10&lt;/a&gt;. The glyph is a simple graph of the atomic structure of mercury.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-11&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;11&lt;/a&gt;. See Incident Log 5176-A3 for more information.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-989328-12&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;. This manifestation destroyed 40% of the facility, comprised its security, and allowed the containment breach of ██ other anomalies.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</description>
